# ChatPanel.ascii
# Streaming chat interface for agent conversation within a project.

## Component: ChatPanel
## Layout: flex-column, full-height

## Visual Structure:
+--------------------------------------------------+
| [Clear]                          [Stop]          | <- chat-actions (top bar)
+--------------------------------------------------+
|                                                  |
|  Loading conversation...                         | <- loading (cond)
|                                                  |
|  +--------------------------------------------+  |
|  |                          You               |  | <- message.user (right-aligned)
|  |                    "user text"              |  |
|  |                      +-------+ +-------+   |  | <- message-images (grid 1fr 1fr)
|  |                      | [img] | | [img] |   |  |   message-image-item: img + filename
|  |                      |"name" | |"name" |   |  |
|  |                      +-------+ +-------+   |  |
|  +--------------------------------------------+  |
|                                                  |
|  +--------------------------------------------+  |
|  | Agent                                      |  | <- message.assistant (left-aligned)
|  | "assistant text"                           |  |
|  |                                     0:15   |  | <- elapsed-timer (last msg, done)
|  +--------------------------------------------+  |
|                                                  |
|  +--------------------------------------------+  |
|  | * * *  Thinking...                         |  | <- thinking-indicator (cond)
|  |                                     0:05   |  |
|  +--------------------------------------------+  |
|                                                  |
|  +--------------------------------------------+  |
|  | Agent                                      |  | <- streaming response (cond)
|  | "partial response text..."  |              |  | <- typing-indicator cursor
|  |                                     0:12   |  |
|  +--------------------------------------------+  |
|                                                  |
|  Interrupted at 0:08                             | <- completion-flash.interrupted (cond)
|  Error after 0:03                                | <- completion-flash.error (cond)
|                                                  | <- messages (scrollable)
+--------------------------------------------------+
| [textarea: "Type a message..."]         [send]   | <- chat-input-container
+--------------------------------------------------+

## Elements:
| ascii                | type          | text_pattern                       | region          | cond                                    |
|----------------------|---------------|------------------------------------|-----------------|------------------------------------------|
| [Clear]              | button        | "Clear"                            | chat-actions    | always                                   |
| [Stop]               | button        | "Stop"                             | chat-actions    | agentPhase in (waiting, streaming)       |
| Loading...           | div           | "Loading conversation..."          | messages        | loading=true                             |
| message.user         | div           | user message content               | messages        | per message where role=user              |
| message.assistant    | div           | assistant message content          | messages        | per message where role=assistant         |
| message-images       | div(grid)     | grid of message-image-item divs    | messages        | msg.images?.length > 0                   |
| message-image-item   | div           | img + message-image-filename span  | message-images  | per image in msg.images                  |
| thinking-dots        | span x3       | -                                  | messages        | agentPhase in (sending, waiting)         |
| thinking-text        | span          | "Thinking..."                      | messages        | agentPhase in (sending, waiting)         |
| elapsed-timer        | span          | /\d+s|\d+:\d{2}/                   | messages        | agentPhase not idle; also on last assistant msg when done |
| streaming response   | div           | partial response + cursor          | messages        | agentPhase=streaming                     |
| typing-indicator     | span          | block cursor                       | messages        | agentPhase=streaming                     |
| interrupted-flash    | div           | "Interrupted at ..."               | messages        | agentPhase=interrupted                   |
| error-flash          | div           | "Error after ..."                  | messages        | agentPhase=error                         |
| textarea             | textarea      | -                                  | chat-input      | always (disabled when streaming)         |
| [send]               | button        | send icon (SVG arrow)              | chat-input      | always (disabled when empty or streaming)|

## States:
| state        | visual changes                                                        |
|--------------|-----------------------------------------------------------------------|
| idle         | No activity indicators shown. Input enabled.                          |
| sending      | Thinking dots + "Thinking..." + timer running. Input disabled.        |
| waiting      | Thinking dots + "Thinking..." + timer running. Input disabled.        |
| streaming    | Streaming message bubble with typing cursor + timer. Input disabled.  |
| done         | Final message bubble with frozen elapsed timer. Input enabled (2s).   |
| error        | Error flash with elapsed time. Input enabled.                         |
| interrupted  | Interrupted flash with elapsed time. Input enabled.                   |

## Interaction Model:
| action              | trigger                        | effect                                  |
|---------------------|--------------------------------|-----------------------------------------|
| Send message        | Enter (no shift) or click send | sendMessage(), phase -> sending          |
| Stop generation     | Click Stop button              | interrupt(), phase -> interrupted        |
| Clear history       | Click Clear button             | clearHistory(), messages reset, phase -> idle |
| Scroll              | Auto on messages/phase change  | scrollToBottom via watch                 |
| Newline in input    | Shift+Enter                    | Inserts newline (no send)               |
